        "Description": "Good evening 47, and welcome to Berlin. Today our client is a millionaire living in Berlin who visits a local club almost every day. However, a few months ago an Icelandic social media user started visiting the club who makes videos of himself going crazy in just his underwear. Recently he has started visiting the club every day, and has even once humiliated the client himself in front of his friends and the camera. The millionaire can no longer bear to watch his behavior. Good luck.",
